  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Three days after wills wake, four Heavenly Court rank eight Gu Immortals appear in the air above Hairy Foot Mountain in Central Continent and conceal their auras. Lian Jiu Sheng names the mountain. Bai Cang Shui starts the opening. After six rounds of attacks, Lian Jiu Sheng deals the crucial blow. The mountain disappears from its spot, and Infallible blessed land opens in front of them.",
      "chapters": [
        845
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_lian_jiu_sheng",
        "char_bai_cang_shui",
        "loc_infallible_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court research ties Infallible blessed land to the hairy man leader. Hairy Foot Mountain was the place where the hairy man leader had once resided. After his death he left an inheritance that gathers other people’s failures into mortal failure Gu, which then condense into success dao marks. After discovering this, Heavenly Court captured Infallible blessed land and used that blessed land as the foundation of the Central Continent Refinement Path Convention.",
      "chapters": [
        845
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_failure_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The surrounding small to middle sized forces did not want to occupy it. Under Bi Chen Tian’s immortal killer move it shines and looks mystical. The whole mountain shakes slightly during the opening.",
      "chapters": [
        845
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bi_chen_tian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan, charging toward it, sees an extremely ordinary mountain, like an inconspicuous hill, and sighs that Infallible blessed land stands there.",
      "chapters": [
        1740
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ordinary-hill",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "An enormous soul sword pierces Chen Yi and strikes the mountain with its remaining force. Hairy Foot Mountain disintegrates. Infallible blessed land still stands among the rubble.",
      "chapters": [
        1741
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
